; Mesa (issue #377, a King of the Hill stage): a broad mesa with the hill fixed
; on it. Two lifts rise from the floor to its flanks, and high ledges overlook it.
; (Stage.hill_spots: HillSpot0.)
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for King of the Hill, and in any
; other mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time ("_other").

